#: userland/apps/reliefplayer/window.cpp:360
msgid ""
"ReliefPlayer\n"
"MP3 / WAV audio and MP4 video player\n"
"\n"
"Ctrl+O: open media\n"
"Space: play or pause\n"
"Left / Right: seek 10 seconds\n"
"Home: return to the beginning\n"
"\n"
"Volume changes affect this player only.\n"
"Supports PCM WAV 8/16/24/32-bit and float32, mono or stereo.\n"
"MP4: H.264, MPEG-4 or HEVC video; AAC or MP3 audio.\n"
"Local files only; no network streams or media library."
msgstr ""
"ReliefPlayer\n"
"MP3 / WAV 音频与 MP4 视频播放器\n"
"\n"
"Ctrl+O：打开媒体\n"
"空格：播放或暂停\n"
"左右方向键：前后跳转 10 秒\n"
"Home：回到开头\n"
"\n"
"音量只影响本程序。\n"
"支持单/双声道 PCM WAV 8/16/24/32 位和 float32。\n"
"MP4：H.264、MPEG-4 或 HEVC 视频；AAC 或 MP3 音轨。\n"
"仅播放本地文件，不含网络串流或媒体库。"

